Package: kalinka-plugin-spotify
Version: @VERSION@
Section: python
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: kalinka-server, kalinka-plugin-sdk (>= 3.5), kalinka-plugin-sdk (<< 4), python3 (>= 3.11), ca-certificates
Maintainer: Dmitry Savin <envelsavinds@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Kalinka-Player/kalinka-plugin-spotify
Description: Spotify Connect input for Kalinka Music Player
 Server-side Spotify Connect plugin that captures compressed Ogg/Vorbis audio
 and serves it to Kalinka's selected renderer. Spotify controls the queue.
 Requires a separately installed librespot 0.8.0 executable with the Kalinka
 pipe bridge and matching Kalinka server and renderer streaming support.
